up><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> has no real solutions. Therefore, our original logarithmic equation has no solutions either.</p>\n</div></div>",
